# Exclude large / environment-specific files from the Docker build context.
# Notably .git holds the Git-LFS objects (the 191 MB corpus DB) that must NOT
# be shipped into the image; the working-tree DB file at
# src/oet_mcp_server/data/oet_corpus.db (after `git lfs pull`) is what's used.
.git
.venv
dist
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
tests
.github